# ==============================================================================
# SERVERLESS EMAIL SERVICE ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (ShopSphere-serverless-email/.env)
# ==============================================================================

# By default, the serverless function automatically provisions an Ethereal test inbox.
# If you want to use custom SMTP (e.g., Gmail, Sendgrid, Resend), configure below:

# SMTP_HOST=smtp.ethereal.email
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_user
# SMTP_PASS=your_password
